.png", "id": "920856615987670", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75289916_920856619321003_1167628786352568211_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PXLAHiSi8pcQ7kNvwFrqA6n&_nc_oc=AdnV7wxBJTJrBt03JG0yOKzdgchJCnGBwcwPsO2QFXTpe76T_LUxvhabccv8TdaSfm4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfvuGb_cO2UpORYu-WNZ0U-aXFPDRnGEMpW9CC8B0q21LQ&oe=69A83018"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 5_2560_1440.png", "id": "727856879468758", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974812_727856882802091_1641997799950234504_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UMRjn8WFidUQ7kNvwGrhlK1&_nc_oc=AdkWbZU8KR34ojDNR9PBtQNUFG5lRjTslfeGa9GlXPCG04nMbyHMymHleRdbqHqrpTI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftAYwbTe7MnxYebrCBkdes7LFFRkG4uE--4GeVL2wo_eg&oe=69A82D40"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Galateum_CoverLandscape.png", "id": "684438640283334", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974677_684438646950000_5562717609088558112_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3WkA-soq09gQ7kNvwHIICFf&_nc_oc=AdntQifSJ2az-CG_1sCXbt8CNDwlBjGD81_bfK-SjGczVsgG5HoRLbclQaKFRhKUuho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfsBYFmLaXrVCdDfYjKw2T2cVdcQPxLDJnu4lT2J_ZGwWw&oe=69A82D73"}, "display_name": "Galateum", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in our unique FPS experience, combining cyberpunk aesthetics with the merciless conditions of a desert planet. Navigate neon-lit buildings and desolate vistas, outmoving and outplaying your opponents.\nCombat isn't just about force - it's about strategy and adaptation. Leverage the jet-pack to traverse the environment, using the map's entire verticality, while engaging in intense gun fights.\nYour cyberpunk survival odyssey starts here.\n\n", "short_description": "Dive into a unique FPS experience on a harsh desert planet. Challenge yourself and other p